{%- comment -%}
  ── SCOOP — SUNDAZE SITE ASSISTANT ────────────────────────────────────────
  A chat bubble pinned to the bottom-right of every page. SCOOP reads this
  store — every product, collection, page and knowledge-hub guide — and
  answers customer questions from it. When it can't answer confidently it
  stops rather than guessing, and hands the shopper a short form so the team
  can pick the question up. That submission goes through Shopify's contact
  form, so it lands in the store's notification inbox alongside every other
  contact enquiry.

  ── HOW IT KNOWS THE SITE ──
  `sdz-scoop-catalog` renders the whole store as JSON at page-render time:
  products with prices, stock, descriptions and effect metafields, plus page
  and article copy. SCOOP parses it the first time a shopper opens the panel.
  Nothing is hard-coded, so editing a product in Shopify admin updates what
  SCOOP says — no theme change needed.

  ── WHAT IS STILL HAND-WRITTEN ──
  The SCOOP_KB array in the script holds policy, legality and education
  answers — the ones that have to be exact rather than paraphrased. Each
  entry is:
      q  — the canonical question (also matched against)
      k  — extra keywords/synonyms a shopper might type
      a  — the answer, as HTML
  Catalogue questions (what exists, what it costs, what it tastes like, what
  it does) are answered live and do not belong in there.

  ── EFFECT ANSWERS AND COMPLIANCE ──
  "What would give me energy?" is answered from the sundaze.* product
  metafields first. Where a product has none, SCOOP falls back to the effect
  words that product's own page already prints — matched literally against a
  fixed vocabulary, never inferred, never expanded through synonyms. Either
  way the rule holds: SCOOP cannot state an effect this store has not already
  published. Fill the metafields in and they take over silently.

  The compliance gate in section 2 of the script is a hard stop on medical
  claims, dosage advice, under-21 shoppers and restricted-state workarounds.
  Read that section before loosening anything in it.

  Setting the metafields up: docs/scoop-assistant/SETUP.md

  ── OPTIONAL: WIRING A REAL LLM ──
  Set `ai_endpoint` below to a URL you control (an app proxy or your own
  serverless function). SCOOP POSTs {question, history, context} to it — the
  `context` being the site content it just retrieved, so the model answers
  from this store rather than from general knowledge — and renders {answer}
  from the response. Never put an API key in the theme; it is public. If the
  endpoint is blank, errors, or replies with no answer, SCOOP falls back to
  the engine below and then to the lead form. It is blank by default and the
  assistant is fully functional without it.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign ai_endpoint = ''

  assign url_faq        = pages['faq'].url        | default: '/pages/faq'
  assign url_contact    = pages['contact-us'].url | default: '/pages/contact-us'
  assign url_about      = pages['about-us'].url   | default: '/pages/about-us'
  assign url_flavors    = pages['flavors'].url    | default: '/pages/flavors'
  assign url_coa        = pages['coa'].url        | default: '/pages/coa'
  assign url_flower     = pages['3-5g-thca-flower'].url      | default: '/pages/3-5g-thca-flower'
  assign url_holes      = pages['hash-holes-collection'].url | default: '/pages/hash-holes-collection'
  assign url_shipping   = pages['shipping-policy'].url       | default: '/pages/shipping-policy'
  assign url_refund     = pages['refund-policy'].url         | default: '/pages/refund-policy'
  assign url_privacy    = pages['privacy-policy'].url        | default: '/pages/privacy-policy'
  # Live handle is terms-conditions; terms-of-service 404s. Both are tried so
  # the link survives whichever handle the page ends up on.
  assign url_terms      = pages['terms-conditions'].url | default: pages['terms-of-service'].url | default: '/pages/terms-conditions'
  assign url_rosin      = collections['hash-rosin'].url      | default: '/collections/hash-rosin'
  assign url_buckets    = collections['sundaze-neapolitan-collection'].url | default: '/collections/sundaze-neapolitan-collection'
  assign url_hub        = '/blogs/knowledge-hub'
  assign url_all        = '/collections/all'
  assign url_account    = routes.account_url
-%}

<style>
  /* ── Launcher ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .scoop {
    position: fixed;
    right: 20px;
    bottom: 20px;
    z-index: 990; /* under the cart drawer (1000) and the age gate (99999) */
    font-family: 'DM Sans', Georgia, sans-serif;
  }

  .scoop__launcher {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 0;
    height: 60px;
    width: 60px;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 999px;
    cursor: pointer;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffd9a3 0%, #ffaed0 52%, #ec4f9a 100%);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(196, 96, 122, 0.36);
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
  }
  .scoop__launcher:hover { transform: translateY(-2px) scale(1.04); box-shadow: 0 14px 36px rgba(196, 96, 122, 0.45); }
  .scoop__launcher:active { transform: scale(0.96); }
  .scoop__launcher:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #3d2314; outline-offset: 3px; }
  .scoop__launcher svg { width: 30px; height: 30px; margin: auto; color: #fff; }

  /* One soft ring on load so the bubble is noticed once, then it settles. */
  .scoop__launcher::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 2px solid rgba(236, 79, 154, 0.55);
    animation: scoop-ring 2.4s ease-out 3;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  @keyframes scoop-ring {
    0%   { transform: scale(1);    opacity: 0.7; }
    100% { transform: scale(1.55); opacity: 0; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .scoop__launcher::before { animation: none; }
  }

  .scoop__badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: -4px; right: -4px;
    min-width: 20px; height: 20px;
    padding: 0 5px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #3d2314;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 20px;
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
  }
  .scoop__badge[hidden] { display: none; }

  .scoop__tip {
    position: absolute;
    right: 72px;
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    white-space: nowrap;
    background: #fffcf4;
    color: #3d2314;
    border: 1px solid #f0ddc2;
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 9px 15px;
    font-size: 13px;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 22px rgba(93, 58, 34, 0.14);
    opacity: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    transition: opacity 0.25s ease, transform 0.25s ease;
  }
  .scoop__launcher:hover + .scoop__tip { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(-50%) translateX(-4px); }

  /* ── Panel ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .scoop__panel {
    position: absolute;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 76px;
    width: 380px;
    max-width: calc(100vw - 32px);
    height: min(600px, calc(100vh - 120px));
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    background: #fffdf8;
    border: 1px solid #f2e2cc;
    border-radius: 24px;
    box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(93, 58, 34, 0.22);
    overflow: hidden;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(12px) scale(0.98);
    transform-origin: bottom right;
    pointer-events: none;
    transition: opacity 0.22s ease, transform 0.22s ease;
  }
  .scoop.is-open .scoop__panel { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0) scale(1); pointer-events: auto; }
  .scoop.is-open .scoop__tip { display: none; }

  .scoop__header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 16px 16px 15px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffe4bd 0%, #ffc3dd 55%, #ffaed0 100%);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(196, 96, 122, 0.18);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .scoop__avatar {
    width: 40px; height: 40px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #fffdf8;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(93, 58, 34, 0.12);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .scoop__avatar svg { width: 22px; height: 22px; color: #ec4f9a; }
  .scoop__id { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
  .scoop__name {
    display: block;
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: #3d2314;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }
  .scoop__status {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: #7c4d34;
    margin-top: 3px;
  }
  .scoop__status i {
    width: 7px; height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #10b981;
    display: inline-block;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  /* The mark is an SVG centred by flex, not a text glyph in a default button
     box. A text "x" inherits UA button padding and the body font metrics, which
     pushed it a few px off centre; this way the cross is geometrically centred
     on every device and font stack. */
  .scoop__close {
    position: relative;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    width: 32px; height: 32px;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
    color: #3d2314;
    font: inherit;
    line-height: 0;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    text-indent: 0;
    cursor: pointer;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    -webkit-appearance: none;
    appearance: none;
    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
    transition: background 0.15s ease;
  }
  .scoop__close svg {
    display: block;
    width: 14px; height: 14px;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  /* Invisible 44px hit area for touch, without changing the drawn circle. */
  .scoop__close::after { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: -6px; }
  .scoop__close:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.9); }
  .scoop__close:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #3d2314; outline-offset: 2px; }

  /* ── Transcript ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .scoop__log {
    flex: 1;
    overflow-y: auto;
    padding: 16px 16px 6px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
    scrollbar-width: thin;
    scrollbar-color: #e8d5be transparent;
  }
  .scoop__log::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 6px; }
  .scoop__log::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #e8d5be; border-radius: 50px; }

  .scoop__msg {
    max-width: 86%;
    padding: 11px 14px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    word-wrap: break-word;
  }
  .scoop__msg--bot {
    align-self: flex-start;
    background: #fff6ea;
    border: 1px solid #f4e2ca;
    border-bottom-left-radius: 5px;
    color: #4a3122;
  }
  .scoop__msg--user {
    align-self: flex-end;
    background: #3d2314;
    border-bottom-right-radius: 5px;
    color: #fff;
  }
  .scoop__msg p { margin: 0 0 9px; }
  .scoop__msg p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .scoop__msg a { color: #cf4d8a; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: underline; }
  .scoop__msg--user a { color: #ffd9a3; }
  .scoop__msg ul { margin: 0 0 9px; padding-left: 18px; }
  .scoop__msg li { margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .scoop__msg strong { font-weight: 600; }

  .scoop__typing { display: flex; gap: 4px; align-items: center; padding: 13px 15px; }
  .scoop__typing span {
    width: 6px; height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #d8a6bd;
    animation: scoop-bounce 1.3s infinite ease-in-out;
  }
  .scoop__typing span:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.18s; }
  .scoop__typing span:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.36s; }
  @keyframes scoop-bounce {
    0%, 60%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); opacity: 0.45; }
    30%           { transform: translateY(-4px); opacity: 1; }
  }

  /* ── Suggestion chips ───────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .scoop__chips {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 7px;
    padding: 4px 16px 10px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .scoop__chips:empty { display: none; }
  .scoop__chip {
    border: 1px solid #f0cfdd;
    background: #fff;
    color: #b8426e;
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 7px 13px;
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 12px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease;
  }
  .scoop__chip:hover { background: #fff0f6; border-color: #ec4f9a; color: #ec4f9a; }

  /* ── Lead capture card ──────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .scoop__lead {
    align-self: stretch;
    max-width: 100%;
    background: #fffcf4;
    border: 1px solid #f0ddc2;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 14px;
  }
  .scoop__lead h4 {
    margin: 0 0 4px;
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #3d2314;
  }
  .scoop__lead p.scoop__lead-sub {
    margin: 0 0 11px;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: #7c4d34;
  }
  .scoop__lead label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(61, 35, 20, 0.6);
    margin: 0 0 4px;
  }
  .scoop__lead input,
  .scoop__lead textarea {
    width: 100%;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    padding: 9px 12px;
    margin-bottom: 9px;
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #3d2314;
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid #ecd8bd;
    border-radius: 10px;
    outline: none;
    transition: border-color 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
  }
  .scoop__lead textarea { resize: vertical; min-height: 60px; }
  .scoop__lead input:focus,
  .scoop__lead textarea:focus {
    border-color: #ec4f9a;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(236, 79, 154, 0.12);
  }
  .scoop__lead-err {
    display: none;
    margin: 0 0 9px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #c0392b;
  }
  .scoop__lead-err.is-shown { display: block; }
  .scoop__lead-btn {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 11px 18px;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #3d2314;
    color: #fff;
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: opacity 0.15s ease;
  }
  .scoop__lead-btn:hover { opacity: 0.88; }
  .scoop__lead-btn:disabled { opacity: 0.5; cursor: not-allowed; }

  /* ── Composer ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .scoop__composer {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 11px 14px;
    border-top: 1px solid #f2e2cc;
    background: #fffdf8;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .scoop__input {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
    max-height: 96px;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: #3d2314;
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid #ecd8bd;
    border-radius: 18px;
    outline: none;
    resize: none;
    transition: border-color 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
  }
  .scoop__input:focus { border-color: #ec4f9a; box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(236, 79, 154, 0.12); }
  .scoop__send {
    width: 40px; height: 40px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffaed0 0%, #ec4f9a 100%);
    color: #fff;
    cursor: pointer;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    transition: transform 0.15s ease, opacity 0.15s ease;
  }
  .scoop__send svg { width: 17px; height: 17px; }
  .scoop__send:hover { transform: scale(1.06); }
  .scoop__send:disabled { opacity: 0.4; cursor: not-allowed; transform: none; }

  .scoop__legal {
    padding: 0 16px 11px;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 10.5px;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: rgba(61, 35, 20, 0.45);
    text-align: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  /* ── Mobile ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .scoop { right: 14px; bottom: 14px; }
    .scoop__panel {
      position: fixed;
      right: 8px; left: 8px; bottom: 84px;
      width: auto;
      max-width: none;
      height: min(560px, calc(100vh - 110px));
    }
    .scoop__tip { display: none; }
  }

  /* ── Product cards ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
     When SCOOP recommends something it shows the product rather than
     describing it — image, price and the published reason it matched. */
  .scoop__cards {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 7px;
    margin: 10px 0 2px;
  }

  .scoop__card {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 11px;
    padding: 9px 10px;
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid #f0ddc2;
    border-radius: 13px;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    transition: border-color 0.15s ease, transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
  }
  .scoop__card:hover {
    border-color: #ec4f9a;
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(196, 96, 122, 0.16);
  }
  .scoop__card:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #ec4f9a; outline-offset: 2px; }

  .scoop__card-img {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 52px; height: 52px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #fff6ea;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-size: 22px;
  }
  .scoop__card-img img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; }

  .scoop__card-body { flex: 1; min-width: 0; display: block; }

  .scoop__card-name {
    display: block;
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.25;
    color: #3d2314;
    /* Long product names wrap rather than blowing out the bubble width. */
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  .scoop__card-meta {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 2px;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: #7c4d34;
  }
  .scoop__card-why {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 3px;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #b8426e;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  }
  .scoop__card-out {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-left: 6px;
    padding: 1px 6px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #f4e2ca;
    color: #7c4d34;
    font-family: 'DM Sans', Georgia, sans-serif;
    font-size: 9.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    vertical-align: middle;
  }

  /* The regulatory line under any answer that mentions effects. Quiet, but
     never optional — see the compliance gate in the script. */
  .scoop__msg p.scoop__fine {
    margin: 9px 0 0;
    padding-top: 8px;
    border-top: 1px solid #f4e2ca;
    font-size: 10.5px;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: rgba(61, 35, 20, 0.5);
  }
</style>

<div class="scoop" id="scoopWidget">
  <div
    class="scoop__panel"
    id="scoopPanel"
    role="dialog"
    aria-modal="false"
    aria-labelledby="scoopName"
    aria-hidden="true"
  >
    <div class="scoop__header">
      <span class="scoop__avatar" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M8 11h8l-4 10-4-10z"/>
          <circle cx="9.5" cy="7.5" r="3.2"/>
          <circle cx="14.5" cy="7.5" r="3.2"/>
          <circle cx="12" cy="5" r="3.2"/>
        </svg>
      </span>
      <span class="scoop__id">
        <strong class="scoop__name" id="scoopName">SCOOP</strong>
        <span class="scoop__status"><i aria-hidden="true"></i> The inside scoop on Sundaze</span>
      </span>
      <button type="button" class="scoop__close" id="scoopClose" aria-label="Close chat">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
          <path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18"/>
        </svg>
      </button>
    </div>

    <div class="scoop__log" id="scoopLog" role="log" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="false"></div>

    <div class="scoop__chips" id="scoopChips"></div>

    <div class="scoop__composer">
      <textarea
        class="scoop__input"
        id="scoopInput"
        rows="1"
        placeholder="Ask SCOOP anything&hellip;"
        aria-label="Type your question for SCOOP"
      ></textarea>
      <button type="button" class="scoop__send" id="scoopSend" aria-label="Send message">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <line x1="22" y1="2" x2="11" y2="13"/><polygon points="22 2 15 22 11 13 2 9 22 2"/>
        </svg>
      </button>
    </div>

    <p class="scoop__legal">
      SCOOP is an automated assistant. Nothing here is medical or legal advice. 21+ only.
    </p>
  </div>

  <button type="button" class="scoop__launcher" id="scoopLauncher" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="scoopPanel" aria-label="Chat with SCOOP">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
      <path d="M8 11h8l-4 10-4-10z"/>
      <circle cx="9.5" cy="7.5" r="3.2"/>
      <circle cx="14.5" cy="7.5" r="3.2"/>
      <circle cx="12" cy="5" r="3.2"/>
    </svg>
    <span class="scoop__badge" id="scoopBadge">1</span>
  </button>
  <span class="scoop__tip" aria-hidden="true">Questions? Get the scoop 🍨</span>
</div>

{%- comment -%} The live site index SCOOP reads from. {%- endcomment -%}
{%- render 'sdz-scoop-catalog' -%}

<script>
  (function () {
    'use strict';

    var widget = document.getElementById('scoopWidget');
    if (!widget || widget.dataset.scoopReady) return;
